"Include it in your gamemode and call %s_CreateTextDraws()\n"
"from OnGameModeInit and %s_ShowTextDraws(playerid)."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
"Sertakan di gamemode Anda dan panggil %s_CreateTextDraws()\n"
"dari OnGameModeInit dan %s_ShowTextDraws(playerid)."

