"TXD %s, model %d\n"
"Click applies it; right-click keeps it in Favourites."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
"TXD %s, model %d\n"
"Klik untuk menerapkan; klik kanan untuk simpan di Favorit."

msgid ""
"%s\n"
"TXD %s, model %d (no model loads this TXD)\n"
"Click applies it; right-click keeps it in Favourites."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
"TXD %s, model %d (tidak ada model yang memuat TXD ini)\n"
"Klik untuk menerapkan; klik kanan untuk simpan di Favorit."

msgid "%s  (%d points)"
msgstr "%s  (%d titik)"

msgid "%s  model %d"
msgstr "%s  model %d"

msgid "%s (missing)"
msgstr "%s (hilang)"

msgid "%s (you)"
msgstr "%s (Anda)"

msgid "%s Browse · %s Map objects · %s Save · %s Shortcuts"
msgstr "%s Jelajahi · %s Objek peta · %s Simpan · %s Pintasan"

msgid "%s The update installs the next time Haumea starts."
msgstr "%s Pembaruan dipasang saat Haumea dimulai berikutnya."

msgid "%s already sits there."
msgstr "%s sudah duduk di sana."

msgid "%s already uses this name."
msgstr "%s sudah memakai nama ini."

msgid "%s drops the selected objects onto the ground."
msgstr "%s menjatuhkan objek terpilih ke tanah."

msgid "%s exists: it is used as it is."
msgstr "%s sudah ada: dipakai apa adanya."

msgid "%s follows path \"%s\", which has no points."
msgstr "%s mengikuti jalur \"%s\" yang tidak punya titik."

msgid "%s follows path \"%s\", which has one point: it walks there and stops."
msgstr "%s mengikuti jalur \"%s\" yang hanya punya satu titik: ia berjalan ke sana lalu berhenti."

msgid "%s has no text."
msgstr "%s tidak punya teks."

msgid "%s is %.0f m off the track: in game it stands on the nearest track instead, at %.1f, %.1f, %.1f."
msgstr "%s berjarak %.0f m dari rel: di game ia berdiri di rel terdekat, di %.1f, %.1f, %.1f."

msgid "%s is at the %d-character limit and may have been cut."
msgstr "%s mencapai batas %d karakter dan mungkin terpotong."

msgid "%s is attached to a target that can't be used by Pawn."
msgstr "%s terpasang ke target yang tidak bisa dipakai Pawn."

msgid "%s is attached to an object that was deleted."
msgstr "%s terpasang ke objek yang sudah dihapus."

msgid "%s is loading another map for everyone..."
msgstr "%s memuat peta lain untuk semua orang..."

msgid "%s is set to show only inside area \"%s\", which is not in the map: it is written without one and shows everywhere."
msgstr "%s diatur tampil hanya di dalam area \"%s\" yang tidak ada di peta: ia ditulis tanpa area dan tampil di mana-mana."

msgid "%s isn't next to the editor. It ships with every release, and is in the source at https://github.com/itsneufox/Haumea-Studio."
msgstr "%s tidak ada di sebelah editor. Ia disertakan di setiap rilis, dan ada di sumber di https://github.com/itsneufox/Haumea-Studio."

msgid "%s joined the session"
msgstr "%s bergabung ke sesi"

msgid "%s left the session"
msgstr "%s keluar dari sesi"

msgid "%s lists every keyboard shortcut; change them in Preferences."
msgstr "%s mencantumkan semua pintasan keyboard; ubah di Preferensi."

msgid "%s moves 0 m and doesn't turn, so its MoveObject does nothing."
msgstr "%s bergerak 0 m dan tidak berputar, jadi MoveObject-nya tidak berbuat apa-apa."

msgid "%s only shows inside area \"%s\", but they are in different virtual worlds or interiors: no player is ever in both."
msgstr "%s hanya tampil di dalam area \"%s\", tetapi keduanya berada di virtual world atau interior berbeda: tidak ada pemain yang berada di keduanya."

msgid "%s pastes objects exactly where they were copied."
msgstr "%s menempel objek persis di tempat objek disalin."

msgid "%s plays %s / %s, which moves only an object's parts: the skin stands still."
msgstr "%s memutar %s / %s, yang hanya menggerakkan bagian objek: skin berdiri diam."

msgid "%s plays %s / %s, which twists the skin out of shape."
msgstr "%s memutar %s / %s, yang memelintir skin hingga cacat."

msgid "%s plays driver recording %s but isn't driving a vehicle: open.mp reports it playing, yet the NPC never moves. Put it in a vehicle as the driver."
msgstr "%s memutar rekaman pengemudi %s tetapi tidak mengemudikan kendaraan: open.mp melaporkannya berjalan, namun NPC tidak pernah bergerak. Taruh di kendaraan sebagai pengemudi."

msgid "%s plays on-foot recording %s while in a vehicle; it needs to be on foot."
msgstr "%s memutar rekaman berjalan kaki %s saat berada di kendaraan; ia harus berjalan kaki."

msgid "%s points the camera at the selection."
msgstr "%s mengarahkan kamera ke pilihan."

msgid "%s shares player attachment slot %d with %s."
msgstr "%s berbagi slot attachment pemain %d dengan %s."

msgid "%s sits in a vehicle that was deleted, so it is saved on foot."
msgstr "%s duduk di kendaraan yang sudah dihapus, jadi disimpan berjalan kaki."

msgid "%s uses a player bone attachment, but its target isn't a player or NPC."
msgstr "%s memakai attachment tulang pemain, tetapi targetnya bukan pemain atau NPC."

msgid "%s walks node file %d, which isn't in the workspace (%s). open.mp downloads it on first use; offline servers need it copied there."
msgstr "%s memakai file node %d yang tidak ada di workspace (%s). open.mp mengunduhnya saat pertama dipakai; server offline perlu menyalinnya ke sana."

msgid "%s won't be offered again."
msgstr "%s tidak akan ditawarkan lagi."

msgid "%s's group has %s, which Windows-1252 (what SA-MP and open.mp clients draw) doesn't have: it is saved as '?'."
msgstr "Grup %s berisi %s, yang tidak ada di Windows-1252 (yang digambar klien SA-MP dan open.mp): disimpan sebagai '?'."

msgid "%s's material text has %s, which Windows-1252 (what SA-MP and open.mp clients draw) doesn't have: it is saved as '?'."
