msgstr "Uji di game (%s) menjalankan peta di server open.mp pribadi."

msgid ""
"Test in game runs the map on a private open.mp server in Haumea's config\n"
"folder. Its files come from this package, or from the workspace server when empty."
msgstr ""
"Uji di game menjalankan peta di server open.mp pribadi di folder config\n"
"Haumea. File-nya berasal dari paket ini, atau dari server workspace bila kosong."

msgid "Test in game: %s"
msgstr "Uji di game: %s"

