msgstr "Uji peta di game"

msgid "Text"
msgstr "Teks"

msgid "Text & audio"
msgstr "Teks & audio"

msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Warna teks"

msgid ""
"Text encoding of labels, material text, textdraws and notes.\n"
"SA-MP and open.mp clients draw text as Windows-1252, as pawno writes it."
msgstr ""
"Pengodean teks untuk label, teks material, textdraw, dan catatan.\n"
"Klien SA-MP dan open.mp menggambar teks sebagai Windows-1252, seperti yang ditulis pawno."

msgid "Text size"
msgstr "Ukuran teks"

msgid "TextDraw %s has %s, which Windows-1252 (what SA-MP and open.mp clients draw) doesn't have: it is saved as '?'."
msgstr "TextDraw %s memiliki %s, yang tidak ada di Windows-1252 (yang digambar klien SA-MP dan open.mp): disimpan sebagai '?'."

msgid "TextDraw %s: %s"
msgstr "TextDraw %s: %s"

msgid "TextDraw mode: edit the textdraw file on a canvas instead of the world."
msgstr "Mode TextDraw: edit file textdraw pada kanvas, bukan di dunia."

msgid "TextDraws"
msgstr "TextDraws"

msgid ""
"Textdraws can't be turned, so a triangle is boxes in steps.\n"
"More steps make a smoother edge. Each step is a textdraw."
msgstr ""
"Textdraw tidak bisa diputar, jadi segitiga dibuat dari kotak bertahap.\n"
"Lebih banyak langkah membuat tepi lebih halus. Tiap langkah adalah satu textdraw."

msgid "Textdraws have their own .pwn file: Save in the TextDraws window or %s."
msgstr "Textdraw punya file .pwn sendiri: Simpan di jendela TextDraws atau %s."

msgid "Textdraws in this map: %d."
msgstr "Textdraw di peta ini: %d."

msgid "Textdraws moved: %d, into %s. Save the map to take them out of it."
msgstr "Textdraw dipindahkan: %d, ke %s. Simpan peta untuk mengeluarkannya dari peta."

msgid ""
"Textdraws now have their own file, which Test in game includes.\n"
"Left in the map they are read-only."
msgstr ""
"Textdraw kini punya file sendiri, yang disertakan Uji di game.\n"
"Jika dibiarkan di peta, textdraw hanya baca."

msgid "Texture"
msgstr "Tekstur"

msgid "Texture / color"
msgstr "Tekstur / warna"

msgid "Texture Browser"
msgstr "Penjelajah tekstur"

msgid "Texture Studio list"
msgstr "Daftar Texture Studio"

msgid ""
"Texture Studio's texture index (alltextures.pwn): search by number, TXD or name.\n"
"From %s."
msgstr ""
"Indeks tekstur Texture Studio (alltextures.pwn): cari berdasarkan nomor, TXD, atau nama.\n"
"Dari %s."

msgid "Textures"
msgstr "Tekstur"

msgid ""
"Textures that repeat without a seam, for floors, walls and long surfaces,\n"
"judged from their edges; a guess, so check how it looks."
msgstr ""
"Tekstur yang berulang tanpa sambungan, untuk lantai, dinding, dan permukaan panjang,\n"
"dinilai dari tepinya; hanya perkiraan, jadi periksa tampilannya."

msgid "Textures: %d"
msgstr "Tekstur: %d"

msgid "That folder doesn't exist."
msgstr "Folder itu tidak ada."

msgid "That has no x, y and z in it."
msgstr "Tidak ada x, y, dan z di dalamnya."

msgid "That isn't a Haumea session."
msgstr "Itu bukan sesi Haumea."

msgid "That target can't accept the selected objects. Click another target or cancel."
msgstr "Target itu tidak dapat menerima objek terpilih. Klik target lain atau batal."

msgid "That's the game's own data. Pick a server's scriptfiles/NPCs/nodes."
msgstr "Itu data bawaan game. Pilih scriptfiles/NPCs/nodes milik server."

msgid ""
"The 8x8 grid of NODES0-63.DAT areas (750 units each).\n"
"Nodes cannot be moved across these boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Grid 8x8 area NODES0-63.DAT (masing-masing 750 unit).\n"
"Node tidak dapat dipindahkan melintasi batas ini."

msgid "The PC game's time-of-day colour grading."
msgstr "Color grading waktu hari milik game PC."

msgid "The Pawn variable. Empty or not a plain name makes one up."
msgstr "Variabel Pawn. Kosong atau bukan nama biasa akan dibuatkan otomatis."

msgid "The SA-MP tab places pickups, 3D labels, actors, classes, gang zones and map icons."
msgstr "Tab SA-MP menempatkan pickup, label 3D, aktor, kelas, gang zone, dan map icon."

msgid "The Truth"
msgstr "The Truth"

msgid "The all-in-one editor for open.mp and SA-MP"
msgstr "Editor serba ada untuk open.mp dan SA-MP"

msgid "The all-in-one editor for open.mp and SA-MP, by itsneufox."
msgstr "Editor serba ada untuk open.mp dan SA-MP, oleh itsneufox."

msgid ""
"The angle the copies cover. 360 spreads them evenly around\n"
"a full circle together with the selection."
msgstr ""
"Sudut yang dicakup salinan. 360 menyebarkannya merata mengelilingi\n"
"lingkaran penuh bersama pilihan."

msgid ""
"The art's pixel size. Smaller cells follow the shapes more\n"
"closely and take more gang zones."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran piksel art. Sel yang lebih kecil mengikuti bentuk lebih\n"
"rapat dan memakai lebih banyak gang zone."

msgid "The attachment contains read-only objects."
msgstr "Lampiran berisi objek hanya baca."

msgid ""
"The chat and text outlines are sized in the player's pixels: on a bigger\n"
"screen the chat takes less of it and outlines are thinner. Textdraws too."
msgstr ""
"Chat dan garis tepi teks berukuran dalam piksel pemain: di layar yang lebih\n"
"besar, chat memakan lebih sedikit ruang dan garis tepi lebih tipis. Textdraw juga."

msgid "The checkpoint's size; players enter it within about this distance."
msgstr "Ukuran checkpoint; pemain masuk dalam jarak sekitar ini."

msgid "The download goes on; the update installs when Haumea restarts."
msgstr "Unduhan berlanjut; pembaruan dipasang saat Haumea dimulai ulang."

msgid "The editor only previews these; they are not saved in the map."
msgstr "Editor hanya menampilkan pratinjau ini; tidak disimpan di peta."

msgid "The fields show the one clicked last."
msgstr "Kolom menampilkan yang terakhir diklik."

msgid "The first selected object goes where you click."
msgstr "Objek terpilih pertama berpindah ke tempat Anda mengklik."

msgid "The first time on a server with accounts: the code you were sent makes your account."
msgstr "Pertama kali di server dengan akun: kode yang dikirimkan kepada Anda membuat akun Anda."

msgid "The game object whose settings the new model takes (19379 is a common choice)."
msgstr "Objek game yang pengaturannya dipakai model baru (19379 pilihan umum)."

msgid "The game skin whose settings the new skin takes."
msgstr "Skin game yang pengaturannya dipakai skin baru."

msgid "The game's"
msgstr "Milik game"

msgid "The game's HUD under the textdraws, where SA-MP shows it, to check they don't cover it."
msgstr "HUD game di bawah textdraw, di tempat SA-MP menampilkannya, untuk memeriksa bahwa textdraw tidak menutupinya."

msgid "The game's NODES*.DAT files couldn't be loaded."
msgstr "File NODES*.DAT milik game tidak dapat dimuat."

msgid "The game's path nodes. open.mp NPCs follow them with NPC_PlayNode."
msgstr "Node path milik game. NPC open.mp mengikutinya dengan NPC_PlayNode."

msgid ""
"The game's radar in the corner of the 3D view, with the map's gang zones.\n"
"Click it for the full map."
msgstr ""
"Radar game di sudut tampilan 3D, dengan gang zone peta.\n"
"Klik untuk peta penuh."

msgid "The group the zones go in."
msgstr "Grup tempat zona ditaruh."

msgid "The heading it is placed at."
msgstr "Arah hadap saat ditempatkan."

msgid "The host's session code, or the password haumea-server was started with."
msgstr "Kode sesi host, atau kata sandi saat haumea-server dimulai."

msgid "The installer stopped (exit code %d)."
msgstr "Installer berhenti (kode keluar %d)."

msgid "The last checkpoint: Finish (or Air finish) shows a flag."
msgstr "Checkpoint terakhir: Finish (atau Air finish) menampilkan bendera."

msgid "The layout is limited to 2,000 objects. Increase spacing for a longer path."
msgstr "Tata letak dibatasi 2.000 objek. Perbesar jarak untuk path yang lebih panjang."

msgid "The map changed. Find duplicates again before removing objects."
msgstr "Peta berubah. Cari duplikat lagi sebelum menghapus objek."

msgid "The map has NPCs or NPC paths: their NPC_* calls only compile and run on open.mp (with its NPCs component), not on a SA-MP 0.3.7 server."
msgstr "Peta punya NPC atau path NPC: pemanggilan NPC_*-nya hanya dapat dikompilasi dan dijalankan di open.mp (dengan komponen NPC-nya), bukan di server SA-MP 0.3.7."

msgid "The map includes the streamer for its areas."
msgstr "Peta menyertakan streamer untuk area-nya."

msgid ""
"The material slot (SetObjectMaterial's index) the texture goes to.\n"
"%s has %d."
msgstr ""
"Slot material (indeks SetObjectMaterial) tujuan tekstur.\n"
"%s punya %d."

msgid "The middle, at the bottom: it stands on the ground where you click."
msgstr "Tengah, di bagian bawah: berdiri di tanah tempat Anda mengklik."

msgid "The mirror's %s coordinate."
msgstr "Koordinat %s cermin."

msgid "The model's length, so the pieces just touch."
msgstr "Panjang model, agar potongan pas bersentuhan."

msgid "The new game folder loads when Haumea restarts."
msgstr "Folder game baru dimuat saat Haumea dimulai ulang."

msgid "The object was imported but couldn't be spawned."
msgstr "Objek diimpor tetapi tidak dapat di-spawn."

msgid ""
"The objects drawn: every scripted object, the selection, or one group.\n"
"Vehicles, SA-MP elements and unchanged world objects are left out."
msgstr ""
"Objek yang digambar: setiap objek skrip, pilihan, atau satu grup.\n"
"Kendaraan, elemen SA-MP, dan objek dunia yang tidak berubah tidak disertakan."

msgid "The parent was deleted, so this attachment is not exported."
msgstr "Induk telah dihapus, jadi lampiran ini tidak diekspor."

msgid "The password is too long."
msgstr "Kata sandi terlalu panjang."

msgid "The path's Pawn variable. NPCs follow it by this name."
msgstr "Variabel Pawn path. NPC mengikutinya dengan nama ini."

msgid "The player's screen (the same one the chat and outlines use)."
msgstr "Layar pemain (yang sama dengan yang dipakai chat dan garis tepi)."

msgid "The player's screen shape. Textdraws stretch with it; the chat doesn't."
msgstr "Bentuk layar pemain. Textdraw meregang mengikutinya; chat tidak."

msgid "The point the copies go around (a vertical axis)."
msgstr "Titik tempat salinan berputar mengelilinginya (sumbu vertikal)."

msgid "The saved file's first lines say which functions to call."
msgstr "Baris pertama file yang disimpan menyebutkan fungsi mana yang dipanggil."

msgid "The selected server TXD could not be loaded."
msgstr "TXD server yang dipilih tidak dapat dimuat."

msgid "The selection contains read-only reference objects."
msgstr "Pilihan berisi objek referensi hanya baca."

msgid "The server keeps a copy of the map whenever it's saved."
msgstr "Server menyimpan salinan peta setiap kali disimpan."

msgid ""
"The server makes at most 1024 gang zones. Use bigger cells, fewer colours,\n"
"or streamed zones."
msgstr ""
"Server membuat paling banyak 1024 gang zone. Gunakan sel lebih besar, lebih sedikit warna,\n"
"atau zona yang di-stream."

msgid "The server only lets who knows it load another map for everyone."
msgstr "Server hanya mengizinkan yang mengetahuinya memuat peta lain untuk semua orang."

msgid "The server's signature didn't check out: something may be between you and it. Not joined."
msgstr "Tanda tangan server tidak cocok: mungkin ada sesuatu di antara Anda dan server. Tidak bergabung."

msgid "The session closed the connection."
msgstr "Sesi menutup koneksi."

msgid "The session didn't answer."
msgstr "Sesi tidak menjawab."

msgid "The session ended."
msgstr "Sesi berakhir."

msgid "The session sent something this version can't read."
msgstr "Sesi mengirim sesuatu yang tidak dapat dibaca versi ini."

msgid "The shell closed (exit code %d)."
msgstr "Shell ditutup (kode keluar %d)."

msgid "The sprites it is made of"
msgstr "Sprite penyusunnya"

msgid "The start screen: workspaces, their maps and the game folder."
msgstr "Layar awal: workspace, peta-petanya, dan folder game."

msgid "The stretch of the path that gets objects, from its first point to its last."
msgstr "Bagian path yang diberi objek, dari titik pertama sampai terakhir."

msgid "The terminal needs Windows 10 version 1809 or later."
msgstr "Terminal membutuhkan Windows 10 versi 1809 atau lebih baru."

msgid "The tested releases everyone gets."
msgstr "Rilis teruji yang didapat semua orang."

msgid "The update failed: %s"
msgstr "Pembaruan gagal: %s"

msgid "The update wasn't installed: %s"
msgstr "Pembaruan tidak terpasang: %s"

msgid "The way it faces, in degrees (the Z rotation). Drag, or double-click to type."
msgstr "Arah hadapnya, dalam derajat (rotasi Z). Seret, atau klik dua kali untuk mengetik."

msgid ""
"The weapon icon keeps its shape (1 in the ini it ships with). Older builds\n"
"and 0 squeeze it to the HUD's width."
msgstr ""
"Ikon senjata mempertahankan bentuknya (1 di ini bawaan). Build lama\n"
"dan 0 memampatkannya ke lebar HUD."

msgid ""
"The wheel zooms round the cursor, the middle button pans.\n"
"Ctrl+wheel sizes the interface instead."
msgstr ""
"Roda memperbesar di sekitar kursor, tombol tengah menggeser.\n"
"Ctrl+roda mengubah ukuran antarmuka."

msgid "The workspace's prefabs are shared with everyone who maps for that server."
msgstr "Prefab workspace dibagikan kepada semua orang yang membuat peta untuk server itu."

msgid "The workspace's prefabs folder"
msgstr "Folder prefab workspace"

msgid "Their role on the whole server (right-click someone under People for this room only)."
msgstr "Peran mereka di seluruh server (klik kanan seseorang di bawah Orang untuk room ini saja)."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid "Then click on an image layer on the canvas (Esc stops)."
msgstr "Lalu klik lapisan gambar pada kanvas (Esc menghentikan)."

msgid "Thermal goggles"
msgstr "Kacamata termal"

msgid "They can't be dragged on the canvas. New ones can still be made."
msgstr "Tidak dapat diseret di kanvas. Yang baru tetap dapat dibuat."

msgid "They go into %s."
msgstr "Textdraw dipindahkan ke %s."

msgid "They stay in the map and are saved with it. TextDraws can move them later."
msgstr "Tetap di peta dan disimpan bersamanya. TextDraws dapat memindahkannya nanti."

msgid "Thirds"
msgstr "Sepertiga"

msgid ""
"ThirteenAG's GTA SA Widescreen Fix: the HUD unstretched and smaller, the radar round.\n"
"Many players have it; check your textdraws both ways."
msgstr ""
"GTA SA Widescreen Fix milik ThirteenAG: HUD tidak diregangkan dan lebih kecil, radar bulat.\n"
"Banyak pemain memakainya; periksa textdraw Anda di kedua kondisi."

msgid "This Haumea has no Namaka bundle (a developer build): use a release, or set HAUMEA_NAMAKA_BUNDLE."
msgstr "Haumea ini tidak punya bundle Namaka (build developer): gunakan rilis, atau atur HAUMEA_NAMAKA_BUNDLE."

msgid "This does not look like a server folder (no gamemodes/, scriptfiles/ or server executable). It can still be the workspace."
